# Copy to `.reposhapeignore` in the repo you are analysing.
#
# gitignore syntax, exclude-only, merged on top of .gitignore. This is the
# scope decision: which trees are yours. It is deliberately a list you write
# rather than a statistic the tool computes, because "exclude the top 0.1% by
# degree" cannot tell a vendored bundle from a genuine architectural hub in
# your own code, and will happily suppress the second.
#
# The lines below are examples. Yours will differ.

vendor/
third_party/
packages/*/dist/
src/generated/
